            '1999-2000 Legazpi City',
            'In seeking the roots of the picture from where the city was named, the officials of the City of Legazpi signed a Sister City Relationship Agreement with the Ayuntamiento de Zumarraga, España on October 27, 1978. Zumarraga in Guipuzcoa, a province of the Basque Country of Spain, is the birthplace of Adelantado Miguel Lopez de Legazpi.',
            'Adelantado was a title used by Spanish conquistadors of the 16th century who served as a governor of a province in Spain or of a Spanish colonial province.'
        ));
    </action>

